(Penny:)Oh, not good.

6
00:00:09,425 --> 00:00:11,625
(Penny:)Still couldn't get in
to see Dr. Gallo.

7
00:00:11,627 --> 00:00:13,227
(Sheldon:)A doctor?

8
00:00:14,197 --> 00:00:15,667
(Sheldon:)Well, I hope
you're not contagious.

9
00:00:15,665 --> 00:00:17,735
(Sheldon:)I've got a weekend
in the telescope room

10
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:20,403
(Sheldon:)I've been excited about
