11
00:00:22,004 --> 00:00:23,274
(Penny:)I'm not sick.
It's for work.

12
00:00:23,272 --> 00:00:25,602
(Penny:)There's this doctor who refuses
to see any sales reps.

13
00:00:25,608 --> 00:00:27,238
(Penny:)I've been trying
to get in for months.

14
00:00:27,243 --> 00:00:28,773
(Leonard:)Well, did you try
wearing the shirt

15
00:00:28,778 --> 00:00:30,408
(Leonard:)I said was
inappropriate for work?

16
00:00:30,413 --> 00:00:33,243
(Penny:)Well, the doctor's a woman,
but...

17
00:00:33,249 --> 00:00:35,449
(Penny:)yes, because
you never know.

18
00:00:36,452 --> 00:00:37,882
(Howard:)What kind of doctor
is she?

19
00:00:37,887 --> 00:00:39,887
(Penny:)Um, a psychiatrist. Why?

20
00:00:39,889 --> 00:00:42,289
(Howard:)Well, what if you make
an appointment as a patient?

21
00:00:42,291 --> 00:00:44,021
(Howard:)Then you'll get to talk to her.

22
00:00:44,026 --> 00:00:46,126
(Penny:)Yeah, they already know
I'm a pharmaceutical sales rep.

23
00:00:46,128 --> 00:00:47,828
(Raj:)Oh. What if Leonard
made an appointment

24
00:00:47,830 --> 00:00:49,860
(Raj:)and tried to lay some
groundwork for you?

25
00:00:49,865 --> 00:00:51,295
(Penny:)That's interesting.

26
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,070
(Leonard:)I'm not gonna make
a fake appointment

27
00:00:53,069 --> 00:00:54,039
(Leonard:)with a psychiatrist.

28
00:00:54,036 --> 00:00:55,806
(Leonard:)What would I say
is wrong with me?

29
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:57,335
(Raj:)Low self-esteem.
Social anxiety.

30
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:59,670
(Sheldon:)Sexual insecurity.

31
00:00:59,675 --> 00:01:02,105
(Leonard:)None of that is true.

